    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "Located in London (London City Centre), Marlin Apartments London Bridge - Empire Square is within a 10-minute walk of Borough Market and The Shard.  This luxury aparthotel is 0.7 mi (1.1 km) from London Bridge and 1 mi (1.6 km) from Sky Garden."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 162 guestrooms, featuring kitchens with full-sized refrigerators/freezers and ovens. 40-inch LED televisions with cable programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Conveniences include desks and microwaves, and housekeeping is provided weekly."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Make use of convenient amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a reception hall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EBorough Market - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Shard - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Globe Theatre - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Tate Modern - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Thames River - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sky Garden - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Tower Bridge - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E London Bridge - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Tower of London - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E St. Paul\u0027s Cathedral - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal National Theatre - 2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Gherkin - 2.2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Liverpool Street - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Westminster Bridge - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E London Eye - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 12.8 km / 7.9 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 30.9 km / 19.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 85.7 km / 53.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 93.2 km / 57.9 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Stansted Airport (STN) - 62.8 km / 39 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
